# Schema-v1 task files the jl head-to-head writes for each configuration: ~4 MB
# of circuit JSON that bench_jl_performance.py regenerates deterministically
# from the same seeds (its README's "Reproducing" section). The committed
# artifacts are the summary, results, figures and log. The `**/` covers the
# follow-up runs' own subdirectories (deep-kicked-ising/, ...), each of which
# writes its own tasks/.
benchmarks/python/jl_performance/**/tasks/

# Rendered docs site (mdbook build-dir); the source is docs/book/src.
docs/book/site/

.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
